{"seq":1,"slug":"color-correction","title":"一次校正","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/color-correction","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"white-balance-correction","title":"白平衡校正与色温还原","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/color-correction/white-balance-correction","wordCount":1867,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"exposure-contrast","title":"曝光与对比度修正","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/color-correction/exposure-contrast","wordCount":1833,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"color-balance","title":"色彩平衡还原与肤色保护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/color-correction/color-balance","wordCount":1927,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"一次校正-简介\">一次校正 简介</h1><p>一次校正（Primary Color Correction）是调色流程的第一阶段，目标是将画面还原到技术上&quot;正确&quot;的状态——中性白平衡、合理曝光、标准对比度。一次校正作用于整个画面（全局调整），不涉及局部选区或创意风格化。</p>\n<p>本章涵盖白平衡校正、曝光与对比度修正、以及色彩平衡还原三个核心主题。掌握一次校正是所有后续创意调色的基础——只有在&quot;正确&quot;的起点上，创意偏移才具有可控性和可复现性。</p>\n"}